# Zennly — full reference

Zennly is a multi-branch booking and operations platform for appointment-based service businesses in Nepal (spas, salons, tattoo studios, gyms, physiotherapy clinics, cleaning services). Founded 2026. Contact: info@zennly.io. Website: {{ site.url }}/ — Demo: {{ site.url }}/demo/ — Pricing: contact for a quote.

## What it does
- Online booking with conflict prevention: staff member, room and time are booked together; clashes are refused at database level, even across branches.
- Staff, therapist and room scheduling, including scheduled staff transfers between branches.
- Discount requests by staff with manager approval and a full audit trail.
- Payment tracking by method (cash, card, online), including part-payments, recorded at point of service.
- Daily revenue reconciliation and a locked daily close.
- Role-based access for owners, managers and front desk.
- Reports: revenue, staff performance, discounts, attendance, referrals.
- Multi-branch dashboard for owners.

## What it does not claim
No fixed public pricing tiers, no free plan, no public API, no mobile-wallet payment integrations are advertised.

## Proof
Live at Nuad Thai Spa Kathmandu: 4 branches, 39 therapists, 12 rooms, 194 services. {{ site.url }}/case-study/

